(librepcb_device 2b5fbc33-c612-4a63-b278-0c080712ad91
 (name "2N3904 onsemi (TO-92-WIDE)")
 (description "onsemi 2N3904 NPN transistor for formed leads at 2.54 mm pitch. Datasheet 2N3904/D, October 2024 Rev. 3, pinout page 1 and leadformed case 135AR page 8: 1=Emitter, 2=Base, 3=Collector. Reuses the Base Library Transistor NPN and TO-92-WIDE. Select footprint compact when placing the device: 1.25 x 1.25 mm copper, 0.75 mm plated holes. Top/component-side view at zero rotation: pad 1 left, pad 2 centre, pad 3 right; flat face toward negative Y (bottom of footprint). Do not apply the BC546 C-B-E mapping. Datasheet: https://www.onsemi.com/download/data-sheet/pdf/2n3904-d.pdf . Hole tolerance note: maximum rectangular lead section 0.56 x 0.52 mm has a 0.7642 mm diagonal, slightly greater than the requested 0.75 mm hole. Fit at worst-case tolerances is not guaranteed; verify the actual leads and finished hole capability. Existing package and BC546 devices are unchanged.")
 (keywords "2N3904,onsemi,NPN,TO-92-WIDE,TO92,leadformed,2.54mm,compact,EBC")
 (author "Simone De Angelis")
